# Project diary

`docs/diary.md` is the running log of this scratch-card project. Other chats must keep it current.

When a task in this project is finished, append the next numbered step before `## Not done yet`. Do this in the same turn as the work. Skip the diary only for a question that changed nothing.

- Plain language. Short. Say what was done and how to see it.
- Next number after the last `## Step N`.
- Do not rewrite earlier steps.
- If the work completes or changes an item under `## Not done yet`, update that list.
- Do not log this rule, tool calls, or attempts that were reverted.

```markdown
## Step 6. Short name

One or two sentences on what changed. Say the file or the page if that helps.
```
